# Generated during the build by the LaTeX include macros (\mixinprovide): the
# comment-stripped or verbatim copies of the real MIXINv2 sources the paper
# \lstinputlistings. The originals are tracked under ../packages and
# ../mixinv2.schema.json; these basename copies are build artifacts.
*.mixin.yaml

# minted output is a build artifact, not source: the highlight cache directory
# and the per-job transient files minted writes at the paper root. The arxiv
# bundle regenerates the cache from scratch during packaging, so none of this
# is tracked.
/_minted/
/_*.config.minted
/_*.data.minted
/_*.errlog.minted
/_*.message.minted
